        <h2 class="pt-intro-heading" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/pittsfield-township-domestic-violence.astro:xtihit">Pittsfield Township Domestic Violence Charges Require An Experienced, Established, and Capable Defense.</h2>
        <img
          class="pt-main-image"
          src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/ee60f2da/images/66aa4f5d078bef17fc3fa3b1_criminal9-96492d-1536.webp"
